            "href": "https://www.scb.se/BO0501-en",
            "label": "Statistics page",
            "type": "text/html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "The calculation of purchase prices of tenant-owned flats are based on the statement of earnings and deductions that the tenant-owners building society provide to the tax authority in connection with a flat sales. The sales are only from the second sale market and not new build flats. This report includes all purchases of flats regardless of lowest price up to a highest price of 20 SEK millions. Conveyances through inheritance, gift or separation of property are not included. Only purchases made by physical persons and where the whole flat is sold are included. It is difficult to use these statistics to make any conclusion concerning the development of prices on flats. In order to do that you must have a better measurement than only the average- or median price that not consider the size of the flat, the location or other elements that affect the market price.",
        "Most recent year’s figures are preliminary."
      ],
